    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      203.57,
      389.85,
      227.99
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CONSTITUTION OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      239.57,
      401.86,
      266.99
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the 13th Amendment to the Constitution(hereafter referred to as the 13th Amendment) provides-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      175.65,
      281.57,
      401.89,
      357.95
    ],
    "text": "(a)for the enactment of laws relating to Law and Orderincluding prevention, detection and investigationof offences and replacement of the existing laws ofParliament by Provincial Councils.(Vide Article154G(8) read with the Item 12:1 of the Appendix Iof List 1 of the 9th Schedule);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      175.65,
      372.65,
      401.88,
      435.95
    ],
    "text": "(b)that the Deputy Inspector General of Police who isthe Head of the Provincial Division of the PoliceForce is responsible to and be under the control ofthe Chief Minister (Vide Item 11:1 of the Appendix1 of List 1 of the 9th Schedule);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      176.37,
      450.53,
      401.89,
      565.91
    ],
    "text": "(c)two of the three members of the Provincial PoliceCommission to be appointed upon the nominationor with concurrence of the Chief Minister andthereby politicizing the Provincial PoliceCommission entrusted with recruitments,promotions, transfers and disciplinary control ofpolice officers of Provincial Police Force. (VideItems 4, 6 and 9:1 of Appendix I of List 1 of the 9thSchedule read with Article 155G(1)(b));",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      175.65,
      580.61,
      401.9,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(d)that members of the National Police Force servingin a province is required to function under thedirections and control of the Deputy InspectorGeneral of the Police of the Province who is in turnresponsible to and under control of the ChiefMinister. (Vide Item 11 of Appendix I of List 1 ofthe 9th Schedule);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.85,
      605.21,
      154.29,
      616.55
    ],
    "text": "25",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      244.27,
      440.13,
      253.34
    ],
    "text": "Preamble",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
